## 10. AI as Corporate Ozempic

### The Great Taste Without the Calories

> *"AI is corporate Ozempic. It gives companies the great taste of growth without the calories of more people. You want to grow revenue by 15% without hiring 15% more people? AI lets you do that. That's why CEOs love it. That's why Wall Street loves it."*

**The Analogy Explained:**
- **Ozempic/Wegovy:** GLP-1 drugs that suppress appetite → weight loss without dieting
- **AI:** Automates cognitive work → margin expansion without headcount growth

> *"Every CEO I talk to — and I talk to a lot of them — has the same two priorities: (1) grow revenue, (2) don't add headcount. AI lets them do both. Revenue per employee is about to go vertical in a way we haven't seen since the Industrial Revolution."*

