**The Thesis:**
> *"The S&P 493 — not the Mag 7 — will see the most margin expansion from AI. Why? Because they have the most inefficient processes to automate. A Mag 7 company already has 40% margins. There's less fat to cut. A PepsiCo has 15% margins. There's massive room for improvement."*

